{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bb53d9b644e58d581bb94f7cc3afb0838f7f60d8db57c8e2ede28461ab136cec", "ja": "（千鶴さんの初公演が終わった。今日は本人と、今後の\n活動方針について話し合おうと思うんだけど……）", "zh": "（千鹤小姐的首场公演结束了。今天我想和她本人谈谈今后的活动方针，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4829a66d31eab19a3db25ef0ccc8716c8ff3ada65623a744b7e1619754ffc3d4", "ja": "千鶴さんならやっぱり、\nセレブにしかできない仕事が……ん？", "zh": "说到千鹤小姐，果然还是应该安排只有名媛才能做的工作……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "f05bbe0617c362ecec5f5d65231038c107f27a1d54f733efd563fbca25bb73b6", "ja": "今月の特集のページは……\nふふ、どのお洋服も素敵ですわね！", "zh": "本月特辑的页面是……\n呵呵，每一件衣服都很漂亮呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "dbc1cce274941cdc2c0adffe8ab25914ffdcc7886e9336a3f11b99f2148075ed", "ja": "あら、このブラウスも素敵！\nアウターを着回せば、違った印象になりますわね……。", "zh": "哎呀，这件女式衬衫也很漂亮！\n搭配不同的外套，就能呈现出不一样的感觉呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9e2eddb7fbac42ed9aa515b2c093005d66ab3ed40fcdacc1823494f27d8cd769", "ja": "千鶴さん、お疲れさまです。\nここにいたんですね。", "zh": "千鹤小姐，辛苦了。\n原来您在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "4b0c2b87bb6bc64391fc0005a7e46ad0df30dbd612dc05519a8a20f782bfbbb1", "ja": "キャッ！？\n……{$P$}！？", "zh": "呀啊！？\n……{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f0bb2535d91de43fd67913a913fde80c98b2abb28331c26be2c43756ef685252", "ja": "あ、すみません。\n驚かせちゃいましたか？", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n吓到您了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "9ff4a8e7d6d594a6ab3a9d9092a0f59eb475f80e5b7bd1161e087ddb86b5fade", "ja": "い、いえ、別に！　驚いてなどいませんわ。\nこれっぽっちも！", "zh": "没、没有，才没有呢！我可没被吓到哦。\n一点点都没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1185e8c4950f279c46380b7acdd93f20450d6b6ce6a982120b794873b356e913", "ja": "そ、そうですか……あれ？\nその雑誌は……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……咦？那本杂志是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "85820010a0ead118e38a0075ea6159a273f15ac16fcadc3ad66e4af9331777f3", "ja": "え？　あ、ああ。これは、\nこちらに置いてあったので……その。", "zh": "诶？啊，嗯。这个是因为放在这里……所以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1010_p", "source_sha256": "35fec532655e54923a3bcc6c44138dd78220c89b4a7fcf5427ab0a9b468deb4d", "ja": "千鶴さんでも、こういうカジュアルなファッション誌を\n読んだりするんですね。", "zh": "原来千鹤小姐也会看这种休闲时尚杂志啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a44d122252ab6868aac1ea18fa954b934ec2fe579db65ecf10368e1f041d406d", "ja": "ハイブランド情報が載っているような、\nセレブな雑誌しか読まないのかと思ってました。", "zh": "我还以为您只看那种刊登奢侈品牌资讯的名流杂志呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "87f8da9e8169726da3ac25926b3b311ee601afb91de5309bfc2225d8e6408a3c", "ja": "も、もちろん！　普段はセレブ御用達の\nファッション誌を定期購読していましてよ！？", "zh": "当、当然！我平时订阅的可是只有名流才会看的时尚杂志！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "6e831a87adf19ea103c6b46cf40e6c1a4794ca2a0062e145a2458aa9d4dda830", "ja": "その雑誌を持って、近くの喫茶……\nカフェに行って読むのが日課ですわ。", "zh": "我会带着那本杂志，去附近的咖啡……\n咖啡馆阅读，这是我的日常。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f2812af6613b23c0b4cd09c2f3b7185e0329ca1b26b921c8b80ad0b4434fa4f5", "ja": "優雅ですね！　でもそれなら、こういう\nカジュアルな雑誌はあまり参考にならないんじゃ……？", "zh": "真优雅啊！不过那样的话，这种休闲杂志是不是不太有参考价值……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "bf03d6da88b324e2864e41d751c32fd56428add935b97f27a3bb69a092acaf11", "ja": "あ、あら、そんなことはありませんわよ、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "啊、哎呀，才不是那回事呢，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "842566431b725db63add684464563ddc383dc0a2036cb403032c1443c6924384", "ja": "わたくしもアイドルになったことですし。これからは\nより一般的な流行にも、敏感でないといけませんわ！", "zh": "毕竟我也已经成为了偶像。从今往后\n必须对更加大众的潮流保持敏锐才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "56e96e2057bc99f68d3559a252041ae881351a121f30fe5168622dbbe2cc666d", "ja": "なるほど……！　千鶴さんは、もうアイドルとして\n先を見据えているんですね。さすがです！", "zh": "原来如此……！千鹤小姐已经在以偶像的身份着眼未来了呢。真不愧是您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "107c15fd0d049139985ff7ab4d32c71e547b87b5e2395a07a4a3b276ddb5282d", "ja": "おーっほっほっほっ……ゴホッ、ゲホッ！\nと、当然のことですわ！", "zh": "哦——呵呵呵呵呵……咳、咳咳！\n这、这是当然的事呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9c3b7a78739ea28d46c6cd5eb299f578735e9676d07d6645c029ec85985332ef", "ja": "ちょうどよかった。実は、今日は今後の\n千鶴さんの活動方針について話そうと思ってたんです。", "zh": "正好。我其实正打算今天和千鹤小姐谈谈今后的活动方针。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "ac314e5ba487eb7ad56a324940afb79af4f883cc53fc55be120d7cb24148009a", "ja": "活動方針……{$P$}は\nなにかプランを考えていますの？", "zh": "活动方针……{$P$}先生有什么计划吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ccb7bcd7c5a795d8b3803ae5e5ecb3814c3fcfeb6a3e02a8628788d9bc7b6142", "ja": "千鶴さんにしかない強みを活かして、\nセレブな方向にしたほうがいいと……。", "zh": "发挥只有千鹤小姐才具备的优势，朝名媛方向发展比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "d8512c1bee6aa2a0a425bfa4e3e6796266eec700dabf466bb7d8a1dc8a10e074", "ja": "そ、そうですわね。わたくしといえばセレブ、\nセレブといえばわたくしですから。", "zh": "是、是这样呢。说到我就是名媛，说到名媛就是我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7bcd477b1d3dd95dbb4067ad4b0ee275dc9495b3bfa1c321353e4dba5504e51c", "ja": "はい……けど、今の話を聞いて\n少し違うかなと思いました。", "zh": "是……不过，听了刚才那番话，我觉得好像有点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1024_p", "source_sha256": "622f4184e27dcce47274bbb4527939f75a78aa73913a1481f8be2d648c2f714e", "ja": "千鶴さんがアイドルとしての勉強をしているなら、\n普通のアイドルがするような仕事もいいかなと。", "zh": "如果千鹤小姐正在学习作为偶像的相关知识，\n我想，做一些普通偶像会接的工作也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "96ad62e23bb39e4be28d7bd3932aa7435e6512418d28988c56fed692e76be669", "ja": "例えば親しみやすい雑誌のモデルとか。研究熱心な\n千鶴さんなら、いい仕事ができると思うんです！", "zh": "比如，担任亲切易懂的杂志模特之类的。像千鹤小姐这样认真钻研的人，我觉得一定能做好这份工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "feed1b159430712154e4c68ddf50949d667a933f86715b287603a7c2a2d29714", "ja": "え……ええ！　もちろんです！　カジュアルな\n雑誌のモデルも、華麗にこなしてみせますわ！", "zh": "呃……嗯！当然了！休闲杂志的模特工作，我也会华丽地完成给你看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "6531de4fca32a40c765111adb4021bd67a42200a7e990389a416cb60296daf2d", "ja": "{$P$}、\n新しいお仕事、期待していますわよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我很期待您的新工作哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "576b69e6126d1d74500590654a749351d4e35059950a3af9883632187caa0b5e", "ja": "はい！　頑張りますね！", "zh": "好的！我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "70b889141117e6f75851069d6d8d268a0080855fbf9ad24a46cb2454ac130b33", "ja": "あ、すみません。急に電話が……\nそれじゃ、失礼します！", "zh": "啊，不好意思，突然有电话打进来……\n那么，我先失陪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "197f98a95d53727c5075c322fd0c558cb1c997d0040652846e5ee380b87515ac", "ja": "はい、お気をつけてくださいまし～……。\n…………。", "zh": "好的，请您路上小心～……\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "065ab73baed88c93e6c4a2f615fbe815f60cbc793f47bbcf9e38dc1407fa973e", "ja": "……はぁ、\nもっと勉強しないといけませんわね……。", "zh": "……唉，\n看来我还得更加努力学习才行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "739a26cebb1fb85e58b12ceb7e0052b16883f7dceee57636b0936e4e73e0790f", "ja": "（千鶴さんの可能性を、プロデューサーの俺が\n勝手に決めつけちゃいけなかったな……）", "zh": "（我这个制作人，不该擅自断定千鹤小姐的可能性啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_004_1033_p", "source_sha256": "385a9c1ad225c6acba4bcdf3169fa7bb08c351f6b369fd6f6f5b6ada1768f24c", "ja": "（セレブな仕事に縛られず、\n色んな仕事で大きく羽ばたいてもらおう！）", "zh": "不要让她被所谓的名流工作束缚，要让她在各种工作中大展翅膀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
